From 622d20b13b889ec27994ce21fe53ac0dfc78b2af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:26:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD review completion confirmation so finished chats
 close and reopen predictably

Resolved reviews append a done-confirmation prompt to the reviewed patch-agent chat. Terminal adapters select and highlight that chat, hide it after a yes reply, keep it available after no, and reopen the just-closed chat when the user sends follow-up text. The commit folds the controller, terminal, harness, regression tests, and workflow documentation together.
